{"id":"bd34a489475a6b08","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ctl-model-checking.md","title":"CTL 模型检查输入与真值集合","display":"df-ctl-model-checking — CTL 模型检查输入与真值集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ctl-model-checking","aliases":["29-df-ctl-model-checking"],"display":"df-ctl-model-checking — CTL 模型检查输入与真值集合","depends_on":["[[29-df-kripke-structure]]","[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]","[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]","[[29-df-ctl-fragment]]"],"source_locator":"Section14.3, p.235, scan250; Section14.4, p.239, scan254","source_basis":"用户 DjVu 文本层；模型检查问题原述已核对；编号输入、指点与全状态接口为本地显式化"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ctl-model-checking"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ctl-model-checking</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ctl-model-checking — CTL 模型检查输入与真值集合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8cb839e87a64afa7\" href=\"?note=8cb839e87a64afa7\" title=\"29-df-kripke-structure\">29-df-kripke-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" href=\"?note=e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-syntax\">29-df-ctl-star-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76daeadc9ac4f409\" href=\"?note=76daeadc9ac4f409\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-semantics\">29-df-ctl-star-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f0b39f920854da20\" href=\"?note=f0b39f920854da20\" title=\"29-df-ctl-fragment\">29-df-ctl-fragment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section14.3, p.235, scan250; Section14.4, p.239, scan254"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户 DjVu 文本层；模型检查问题原述已核对；编号输入、指点与全状态接口为本地显式化"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\([n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq[n]^2\">\\(R\\subseteq[n]^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i\\subseteq[n]\">\\(P_i\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Kripke}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{Kripke}_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8cb839e87a64afa7\" href=\"?note=8cb839e87a64afa7\" title=\"29-df-kripke-structure\">29-df-kripke-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_k\">\\(\\mathsf S_k\\)</span> 是 CTL* 状态树集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k\">\\(\\mathcal C_k\\)</span> 是规范 CTL 代码集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_k:\\mathcal C_k\\to\\mathsf S_k\">\\(\\varepsilon_k:\\mathcal C_k\\to\\mathsf S_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f0b39f920854da20\" href=\"?note=f0b39f920854da20\" title=\"29-df-ctl-fragment\">29-df-ctl-fragment</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_s^K\">\\(V_s^K\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"76daeadc9ac4f409\" href=\"?note=76daeadc9ac4f409\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-semantics\">29-df-ctl-star-semantics</a> 的状态真值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathcal C_k\">\\(c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\)</span>；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k[c]\">\\(k[c]\\)</span> 将该公式固定，结构及所指状态仍作为输入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_{k,n}\\coloneqq\\{([n],R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\\mid R\\subseteq[n]^2\\land(P_i)_{i&lt;k}\\in\\mathcal P([n])^k\\land\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(([n],R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k}))\\},\\qquad\\mathcal K_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathcal K_{k,n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K_{k,n}\\coloneqq\\{([n],R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\\mid R\\subseteq[n]^2\\land(P_i)_{i&lt;k}\\in\\mathcal P([n])^k\\land\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(([n],R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k}))\\},\\qquad\\mathcal K_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathcal K_{k,n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}*}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,s,a)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land s\\in\\pi_1(K)\\land a\\in\\mathsf S_k\\land V_s^K(a,s)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}*}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,s,a)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land s\\in\\pi_1(K)\\land a\\in\\mathsf S_k\\land V_s^K(a,s)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,s,c)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land s\\in\\pi_1(K)\\land c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\land V_s^K(\\varepsilon_k(c),s)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,s,c)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land s\\in\\pi_1(K)\\land c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\land V_s^K(\\varepsilon_k(c),s)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k[c]\\coloneqq\\{(K,s)\\mid(K,s,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k[c]\\coloneqq\\{(K,s)\\mid(K,s,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL},\\forall}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,c)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\land\\forall s\\in\\pi_1(K)\\;(K,s,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL},\\forall}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,c)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\land\\forall s\\in\\pi_1(K)\\;(K,s,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL},I}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,I,c)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land I\\subseteq\\pi_1(K)\\land c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\land\\forall s\\in I\\;(K,s,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL},I}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,I,c)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land I\\subseteq\\pi_1(K)\\land c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\land\\forall s\\in I\\;(K,s,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\;\\forall c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\;\\bigl((K,\\varnothing,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL},I}_k\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\;\\forall c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\;\\bigl((K,\\varnothing,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL},I}_k\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷235页、扫描250将模型检查描述为输入结构和公式、判断满足；印刷239页、扫描254说明其与数据库查询求值的联系。本条采用有限编号状态域，以使所有输入构成集合，并明确区分指点、全状态和指定初始集合的真值问题。初始集合为空时的全称检查为真；若应用要求非空初始集合，应在输入条件另行加入。</p>\n<p>固定 c 的切片说明“只让结构变化”的数据问题；三元组集合让结构和公式均变化。此处未声称它们具有相同复杂度，也未为符号化输入与显式图输入指定同一成本。原书 Fact14.30 另涉及 CTL* 翻译中的布尔变量，其语法与空间账本不由本条定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-kripke-structure","status":"resolved","id":"8cb839e87a64afa7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-kripke-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"76daeadc9ac4f409","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"f0b39f920854da20","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-fragment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-kripke-structure","status":"resolved","id":"8cb839e87a64afa7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}$；$[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$。$R\\subseteq[n]^2$，$P_i\\subseteq[n]$（$i<k$）；$\\operatorname{Kripke}_k$ 见 [[29-df-kripke-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"f0b39f920854da20","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf S_k$ 是 CTL* 状态树集合，$\\mathcal C_k$ 是规范 CTL 代码集合，$\\varepsilon_k:\\mathcal C_k\\to\\mathsf S_k$ 见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]。$V_s^K$ 是 [[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]] 的状态真值。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"76daeadc9ac4f409","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf S_k$ 是 CTL* 状态树集合，$\\mathcal C_k$ 是规范 CTL 代码集合，$\\varepsilon_k:\\mathcal C_k\\to\\mathsf S_k$ 见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]。$V_s^K$ 是 [[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]] 的状态真值。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq[n]^2","display":false},{"tex":"P_i\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"i<k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Kripke}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_k:\\mathcal C_k\\to\\mathsf S_k","display":false},{"tex":"V_s^K","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathcal C_k","display":false},{"tex":"k[c]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_{k,n}\\coloneqq\\{([n],R,(P_i)_{i<k})\\mid R\\subseteq[n]^2\\land(P_i)_{i<k}\\in\\mathcal P([n])^k\\land\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(([n],R,(P_i)_{i<k}))\\},\\qquad\\mathcal K_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathcal K_{k,n}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}*}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,s,a)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land s\\in\\pi_1(K)\\land a\\in\\mathsf S_k\\land V_s^K(a,s)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,s,c)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land s\\in\\pi_1(K)\\land c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\land V_s^K(\\varepsilon_k(c),s)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k[c]\\coloneqq\\{(K,s)\\mid(K,s,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL},\\forall}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,c)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\land\\forall s\\in\\pi_1(K)\\;(K,s,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL},I}_k\\coloneqq\\{(K,I,c)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\land I\\subseteq\\pi_1(K)\\land c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\land\\forall s\\in I\\;(K,s,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL}}_k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall K\\in\\mathcal K_k\\;\\forall c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\;\\bigl((K,\\varnothing,c)\\in\\operatorname{MC}^{\\mathrm{CTL},I}_k\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":3065,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-fragment]]、[[29-df-ctl-model-checking]] — CTL 规范代码、指点及全状态模型检查接口"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ctl-model-checking]]"}],"outgoing":["8cb839e87a64afa7","e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","76daeadc9ac4f409","f0b39f920854da20"]}